    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are proud to present 14 Fairfield Avenue which is a two-bedroom maisonette, ideally located in the heart of East Wall, Dublin 3. \n\nUpon entering, you are greeted by a private entrance hallway which leads directly to a staircase, guiding you to the main living accommodation at first-floor level. The landing provides access to all principal rooms.\n\nThe living/dining room is a bright and inviting space, featuring laminate flooring, a fireplace with mantle surround, and a desirable south-west facing aspect that fills the room with natural light. Built-in storage further enhances practicality.\n\nThe kitchen is fitted with a range of eye and floor level units and is finished with laminate flooring..\n\nThe property comprises two well-proportioned bedrooms, both finished with laminate flooring. The main bedroom benefits from built-in wardrobes and also houses the gas boiler.\n\nThis maisonette is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, investors, and those seeking home in a convenient and well-established location close to Dublin City Centre.\n\nThe location of 14 Fairfield Avenue is second to none, ideally positioned in the well-established and increasingly popular area of East Wall, Dublin 3. The property is within walking distance of Dublin City Centre, the IFSC, and a host of local amenities including shops, cafés, schools, and recreational facilities. Excellent transport links are available nearby, with multiple Dublin Bus routes and Clontarf DART station just a short distance away, providing easy access across the city. The area is also within close proximity to Fairview Park, East Point Business Park, and the Port Tunnel, ensuring convenient connectivity to Dublin Airport and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - \nPrivate entrance hallway with carpet flooring, leading directly to the staircase and first-floor accommodation.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 3.89m x 3.21m\nBright, south-west facing living space featuring laminate flooring, fireplace with mantle surround, and built-in storage.\n\nKitchen - 2.40m x 1.52m\nA kitchen with laminate flooring, fitted with a range of eye and floor level units.\n\nBedroom One - 3.88m x 3.45m\nSpacious double bedroom with laminate flooring, built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom Two - 3.88m x 2.34m\nWell-proportioned second bedroom with laminate flooring.\n\nAncillary room - 2.23m x 1.93\nFeatures laminated flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.09m x 1.85m\nFully fitted bathroom with shower, wash hand basin, and WC.\n\nAttic - \nSpacious attic area accessed via Stira folding stairs\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Two-bedroom layout</li><li> Bright south-west facing living/dining room</li><li> Fireplace with mantle surround</li><li> Double/Triple glazed windows</li><li> Gas fired central heating</li><li> Prime location close to Dublin City Centre</li><li> Walking distance to IFSC, East Point Business Park & Fairview Park</li><li> Well serviced by public transport including Dublin Bus & nearby DART</ul>"
      },
      {
